      "content": "That's a really strong point about the risk to democracy. If these global institutions start making the heavy decisions that should be left to local voters, doesn't that pretty much render national elections meaningless? It seems like the people pushing for this \"evolution\" are basically trying to bypass the will of the people in favor of an unelected global elite.",
